---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
import Link from "@/components/ui/Link.astro";
import Button from "@/components/ui/Button.astro";
import Contact from "@/components/sections/Contact.astro";
import { cvHref } from "@/i18n/utils";

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const lang = "en";
const cv = cvHref(lang, base);
const cvFile = cv.slice(base.length);

const breadcrumbLd = JSON.stringify({
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
  itemListElement: [
    { "@type": "ListItem", position: 1, name: "Home", item: "https://wavival.dev/en/" },
    { "@type": "ListItem", position: 2, name: "About", item: "https://wavival.dev/en/about/" },
  ],
});
---

<Layout
  title="About me | Valentina Ramirez"
  description="Self-taught Full Stack Developer, founder of Lumina W. Experience with Django, React, and Next.js, building real products through continuous learning."
  lang="en"
  preloadHero
  alternates={[
    { hreflang: "es", href: "https://wavival.dev/sobre-mi/" },
    { hreflang: "en", href: "https://wavival.dev/en/about/" },
    { hreflang: "x-default", href: "https://wavival.dev/sobre-mi/" },
  ]}
>
  <section class="section" data-aos="fade-up">
    <p class="section-subtitle">Who's behind the code</p>
    <h1 class="section-title">About me</h1>

    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col md:flex-row-reverse items-center md:items-start gap-10">
      <div class="w-full md:w-2/5 flex justify-center shrink-0">
        <img
          src={`${base}images/profile.webp`}
          alt="Profile photo of Valentina Ramirez"
          decoding="async"
          width="320"
          height="320"
          class="w-64 h-64 md:w-80 md:h-80 rounded-full object-cover border-4 border-[var(--brand-blue)] shadow-lg"
        />
      </div>

      <div class="w-full md:w-3/5 flex flex-col gap-5">
        <p
          class="text-[var(--text-primary)] text-lg md:text-xl font-display font-semibold leading-snug"
        >
          I'm Valentina Ramirez. I build products end to end, from the data model to the interface
          people use, and I founded Lumina W to do it on my own terms.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2" aria-label="Focus areas">
          <span class="chip">Django · DRF</span>
          <span class="chip">React · TypeScript</span>
          <span class="chip">Next.js</span>
          <span class="chip">PostgreSQL</span>
          <span class="chip">AI</span>
          <span class="chip">Security</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[var(--text-muted)] leading-relaxed">
          I came to code without a laid-out path and learned it by building. That self-taught route
          left me with a concrete way of working: I am not satisfied with something that works, I
          need to understand why it works. That is the difference between copying a solution and
          being able to sustain it when it breaks at 2am.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div
      class="mt-12 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4"
      aria-label="Summary"
      data-aos="fade-up"
    >
      <div
        class="rounded-2xl border border-[var(--border-base)] border-b-[4px] p-5 text-center sm:text-left"
      >
        <p class="font-display font-bold text-3xl text-[var(--brand-blue)]">Full Stack</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-[var(--text-muted)] mt-1">Django · React, in production</p>
      </div>
      <div
        class="rounded-2xl border border-[var(--border-base)] border-b-[4px] p-5 text-center sm:text-left"
      >
        <p class="font-display font-bold text-3xl text-[var(--brand-blue)]">Lumina W</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-[var(--text-muted)] mt-1">Founder, custom product</p>
      </div>
      <div
        class="rounded-2xl border border-[var(--border-base)] border-b-[4px] p-5 text-center sm:text-left"
      >
        <p class="font-display font-bold text-3xl text-[var(--brand-blue)]">Self-taught</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-[var(--text-muted)] mt-1">Continuous learning, no shortcuts</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 flex flex-col gap-4">
      <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-xl text-[var(--text-primary)]">How I work</h3>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-5" data-aos="fade-up">
        <div class="card">
          <h4 class="font-display font-semibold text-lg text-[var(--text-primary)]">
            The problem first
          </h4>
          <p class="text-[var(--text-muted)] leading-relaxed mt-2">
            Before opening the editor I want to know who will use this, what decision they need to
            make, and what happens when the data does not arrive. The framework comes after.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h4 class="font-display font-semibold text-lg text-[var(--text-primary)]">
            Understanding the why
          </h4>
          <p class="text-[var(--text-muted)] leading-relaxed mt-2">
            Django and DRF for a solid foundation, React, TypeScript, and Next.js for interfaces and
            apps that do not feel fragile, PostgreSQL when the relational model matters. Every
            choice with a reason.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h4 class="font-display font-semibold text-lg text-[var(--text-primary)]">
            Security and AI from the start
          </h4>
          <p class="text-[var(--text-muted)] leading-relaxed mt-2">
            They are not decorations glued on at the end: they enter the design from the first
            endpoint, not when something has already broken in production.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div
      class="mt-12 rounded-2xl border border-[var(--border-base)] border-l-[4px] border-l-[var(--brand-blue)] bg-[var(--bg-card)] p-8 flex flex-col gap-4"
      data-aos="fade-up"
    >
      <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-xl text-[var(--text-primary)]">What I build</h3>
      <p class="text-[var(--text-muted)] leading-relaxed">
        Real applications, not demos: multi-user systems with complex business logic, custom APIs,
        and products that live in production. From an offline-first agro-industrial SaaS to OWASP
        code analysis, I am drawn to software that solves a measurable problem for a real person.
        Through Lumina W I bring that same idea to clients: a custom product, built to last and not
        to impress in a screenshot.
      </p>
      <Link href={`${base}en/projects`} aria-label="See Valentina Ramirez's projects">
        See projects
      </Link>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-5" data-aos="fade-up">
      <div class="card flex flex-col gap-4">
        <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-xl text-[var(--text-primary)]">
          Parallel education
        </h3>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
          <div class="border-l-4 border-[var(--brand-blue)] pl-4">
            <p class="font-display font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)]">SENA</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-[var(--text-muted)]">Software Analysis and Development</p>
          </div>
          <div class="border-l-4 border-[var(--brand-blue)] pl-4">
            <p class="font-display font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)]">
              U. de San Buenaventura
            </p>
            <p class="text-sm text-[var(--text-muted)]">English Language</p>
          </div>
          <div class="border-l-4 border-[var(--brand-blue)] pl-4">
            <p class="font-display font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)]">Platzi</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-[var(--text-muted)]">
              Self-taught training in Web Development, Artificial Intelligence, and Information
              Security
            </p>
            <Link
              href="https://platzi.com/p/wavival"
              target="_blank"
              class="!text-xs"
              aria-label="Valentina Ramirez's Platzi profile"
            >
              My Platzi profile
            </Link>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card flex flex-col gap-4">
        <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-xl text-[var(--text-primary)]">Outside the code</h3>
        <p class="text-[var(--text-muted)] leading-relaxed">
          What I enjoy most also teaches me how to work: drums gave me structure and rhythm, cooking
          taught me to follow a process and improvise when needed, and music and reading keep my
          curiosity alive. Learning does not turn off when I close the laptop: it is the way I live
          inside and outside of code.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-auto" aria-label="Interests outside the code">
          <span class="chip">Drums</span>
          <span class="chip">Cooking</span>
          <span class="chip">Music</span>
          <span class="chip">Reading</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <blockquote class="mt-14 max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center" data-aos="fade-up">
      <p
        class="italic font-display font-semibold text-lg md:text-xl text-[var(--text-primary)] leading-snug"
      >
        "Learning is not a stage that ends: it is the way I work. Every project leaves me knowing
        something I did not know when I started."
      </p>
      <footer class="mt-4 text-[var(--text-muted)]">
        Author of the <Link
          href="https://blog.luminaw.co/"
          target="_blank"
          class="inline !text-xs"
          aria-label="Lumina W blog written by Valentina Ramirez"
        >
          Blog W
        </Link>, where I write what I learn.
      </footer>
    </blockquote>

    <div
      class="mt-14 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-5 border-t border-[var(--border-base)] pt-10"
      data-aos="fade-up"
    >
      <Button
        href={cv}
        download={cvFile}
        icon="download-cv-white"
        aria-label="Download Valentina Ramirez's CV as PDF"
      >
        Download CV
      </Button>
      <Link
        href="https://linkedin.com/in/wavival"
        target="_blank"
        icon="linkedin"
        aria-label="Valentina Ramirez on LinkedIn"
      />
      <Link
        href="https://github.com/wavival"
        target="_blank"
        icon="github"
        aria-label="Valentina Ramirez on GitHub"
      />
      <Link
        href="https://instagram.com/wavival"
        target="_blank"
        icon="instagram"
        aria-label="Valentina Ramirez on Instagram"
      />
      <Link
        href="https://wa.me/573016560222"
        target="_blank"
        icon="whatsapp"
        aria-label="Valentina Ramirez on WhatsApp"
      />
    </div>
  </section>

  <Contact lang="en" />
  <script is:inline type="application/ld+json" set:html={breadcrumbLd} />
</Layout>
